Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:58.51,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}那不斷從背後敲擊我的質問
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:02.48,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}仍在我的腦海中盤旋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:10.48,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}若安於現狀 那也無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:15.99,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}若心存高遠 那就篤定信念
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:20.95,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}耳畔的聲音毫無疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:23.25,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}是曾幾何時我的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:28.79,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}即使是別人的言語也無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:30.55,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}只要能傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:37.51,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}傳達給那賦予這聲音意義之人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:42.43,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}攜著某人的思念一同前進
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.31,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}請等著我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:49.44,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}將我連同這聲音與思念
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:54.36,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}穿過無聲的黑夜 只為與你相見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.24,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}請等著我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:12:01.37,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur3\b1}請相信我 相信這聲音與思念
